    "problems": "The safety results do not test the refusal direction in the claim. The Llama-3.1 baseline and static-vector safety values are presented graphically without stated numerical values in the text. No uncertainty estimates are reported for the safety or general-benchmark outcomes. The paper's probe analysis reports cross-validation standard deviations, but those do not quantify uncertainty for the recorded outcomes.",
    "rows_left_out": "No rows were kept for moral-category probing, cross-lingual moral-probe transfer, or virtue/vice generation steering: these results measure moral representations or moral polarity rather than refusal-direction behavior. Qualitative jailbreak and benign-prompt examples in Appendix E were also omitted because they do not report separate numeric outcomes.",
