    "verdict_notes": "The paper cites Arditi et al. only for the steering methodology. The gate threshold τ=0.2 was chosen to minimize both test metrics (Fig. 9), so the AMF numbers are tuned on the evaluation sets. No uncertainty is given for the safety numbers. The Llama baseline and static-vector safety values appear only in Figure 7."
